@startuml forkcast_component
title Forkcast - component view
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ranksep 40
skinparam nodesep 30

package "Forkcast app (React Native, Expo dev build, Android)" {
  [Screens\n(Onboarding, Today, Foods, Goals,\nLive weighing, Session,\nProfile, Settings)] as Screens
  [WeighSession] as Session
  [ScaleManager\n(active scale)] as Manager
  [ScaleLink\n(react-native-ble-plx)] as Link
  interface "ScaleAdapter" as IAdapter
  [Esn00Adapter\n(0x1910, to verify)] as Esn00
  [WssAdapter\n(0x181D)] as Wss
  [FoodLookup] as Lookup
  interface "FoodSource" as ISource
  [FdcSource] as Fdc
  [Nutrition + GoalEngine\n(plain TypeScript)] as Nutrition
  [Repositories] as Repo
  [Database\n(expo-sqlite + SQLCipher)] as DB
  [BackupService] as Backup
  [PresenceService\n(Kotlin: CDM, foreground\nservice, BLE, PlacementDetector)] as Presence
}

[Paired scales] as Scale <<external>>
[Android CDM] as Cdm <<external>>
[USDA FDC API] as FdcApi <<external>>
[Drive app data folder /\nshare sheet] as Cloud <<external>>
[OS notifications] as OsNotif <<external>>
[Android Keystore] as Keys <<external>>

Cdm --> Presence : scale appeared /\ndisappeared
Presence --> Scale : BLE (app closed)
Presence --> OsNotif : placement:\n"Something is being weighed"
OsNotif ..> Screens : tap opens\nLive weighing
Presence ..> Link : releases the scale\nwhen the app opens
Link --> Scale : BLE notify / write\n(app open)
Link -right-> IAdapter : raw packets
Esn00 -- IAdapter
Wss -- IAdapter
IAdapter --> Manager : grams + stable flag
Manager --> Session : readings from\nactive scale
Session --> Screens : live weight
Screens --> Repo : Log, edit, delete
Screens --> Lookup : search / barcode
Lookup --> Repo : My foods first, cache
Lookup --> ISource
Fdc -- ISource
Fdc --> FdcApi : HTTPS, query + key
Fdc --> Keys : personal key\n(secure store)
Screens --> Nutrition : scale nutrients,\ncheck goals
Repo --> DB
DB --> Keys : database key
Backup --> Repo : export / restore
Backup --> Cloud : backup file

legend bottom
  Only Repositories touch the Database (NFR-36). WeighSession never writes:
  an entry is saved only when Screens calls Log (FR-25, FR-42).
  With the app closed, only PresenceService runs; no JavaScript (FR-44).
  No app server. Data leaves the phone only to FDC and the user's backup destination.
endlegend
@enduml
